  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Each year, Dress for Success Sydney helps over 2,500 women across NSW regain financial independence from our 3 showrooms in Sydney, Illawarra, and Newcastle-Hunter.   Over the last 3 years, an increase in demand for our services mean we are no longer able to help women without moving.   This EOFY give generously to help us, help more women transform their lives across NSW. We&apos;re raising funds for both the Sydney and Illawarra showrooms and need your donation to support this move.</narrative>
  </description>
